# Last live tile: Haitei Raoyue tsumo on the 70th live draw (0 live tiles remaining).
# Also verifies that ankan is illegal with 0 live tiles remaining (rules.md §4.18).
# After 69 auto_tsumogiri turns (live draws 0..68 discarded), Seat 1 draws live[69] (7s).
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + tsumo 7s (last live tile)
#   Yaku: tsumo (1) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) + haitei (1) = 4 han.
#   Dora indicator 1z -> dora 2z (0 dora).
#   Fu: Pinfu + Tsumo = fixed 20 fu.
#   Non-dealer tsumo 4 han 20 fu: 1300 from non-dealers (Seats 2, 3), 2600 from dealer (Seat 0).
#   Total to Seat 1: 1300 + 1300 + 2600 = 5200.

[meta]
name: last_tile_haitei_tsumo
